# @file Byerley Turk - Recruitment
# @author 黑衣剑士-星爆气流斩准备就绪
# @author Katze (translator)
recruit:
  title: The Miracle of Meeting You
  lines:
    - As always, while watching the prospective young %UMA% race and committing %THEY% movements and strategies to memory, %YOU% looked up and unexpectedly met a pair of unforgettable eyes.
    - acc: 1
      content: 「This is... unbelievable.」
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: ???
        - 「Why that expression? Every child here has a bright future ahead, do they not?」
    - A strange sensation at the waist sent a jolt to the brain.
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: ???
        - 「As a trainer, you still have a long way to go. Still, you do have your merits.」
    - %YOU% turned to find the commanding Umamusume from the dream standing there once more, with dark brown hair, beautiful eyes, and the same scar over her right eye. She looked %YOU% up and down until her gaze reached %YOU%'s crotch.
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「As a trainer, you still have a long way to go. Still, you do have your merits.」
    - The words sounded aloof, but %YOU% sensed a trace of shyness, reminiscent of the softness she had shown after %YOU% broke through her defenses.
    - Your eyes met. Then %CHARA% smiled with quiet satisfaction and spoke.
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「Then, as an answer to your wish, become my trainer.」
